    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>G\u00d8RKJES \u2013 Finger Food Fighting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A mountain full of questions. And even more pickles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shifting platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing stays still. And you're being watched.<br>You jump, dodge, collect, shoot \u2013 instinctively.<br>Whatever\u2019s pulling you upward remains unclear.<br>But something feels off. Not just the place. Not just the jar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Change your path \u2013 alone, with, or against your friends.</strong><br>Use what you find.<br>And don\u2019t stand still for too long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>G\u00d8RKJES \u2013 Finger Food Fighting isn\u2019t what you think it is.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But it knows exactly what it wants from you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedural Level Generation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614580/extras/bd4f0abd43f7d87443108e9d918ef1ae.poster.avif?t=1755008389\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614580/extras/bd4f0abd43f7d87443108e9d918ef1ae.webm?t=1755008389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614580/extras/e2a9afdfd8e08cbb907b02bc6ef950af.poster.avif?t=1755008389\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto